t_fair_val":22.51,"premium_pct":-32.1,"is_undervalued":true,"pe_trailing":24,"pe_forward":21.1,"pb_trailing":0.2,"pb_forward":0.2,"div_yield":1.15,"ps_ratio":6.6,"fcf_to_ev":5.45,"fcf_to_mcap":3.8,"liab_to_assets":80.6,"cash_to_assets":2.5,"current_ratio":10516423000,"roe":18,"roa":8,"moat":{"ticker":"KKRS","period":"2026Q2","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"KKR 作為全球領先的另類資產管理公司，其品牌代表著專業、信任和卓越的投資業績。這使得 KKR 能夠吸引頂級的機構投資者和高淨值客戶，並在募資時獲得顯著優勢。然而，其定價權主要體現在管理費和績效費的收取上，這在一定程度上受到市場競爭和客戶談判能力的制約，並非絕對的定價權。其品牌價值更多體現在募資能力和聲譽上，而非直接的產品定價能力。","comment_en":"KKR's brand signifies expertise, trust, and strong investment performance in the alternative asset management space. This allows KKR to attract top-tier institutional investors and high-net-worth clients, providing a significant fundraising advantage. However, its pricing power is primarily reflected in management and performance fees, which are somewhat constrained by market competition and client negotiation power, rather than absolute pricing control. The brand value is more about fundraising prowess and reputation than direct product pricing ability."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":5,"comment_zh":"金融服務業的進入壁壘主要來自嚴格的監管要求和牌照。KKR 作為一家成熟的金融機構，已建立了完善的合規體系和運營能力，能夠滿足全球各地的監管標準。然而，這並非專利或獨家技術壁壘，而是行業普遍存在的准入門檻。監管環境的變化可能帶來挑戰，但也為合規的成熟機構提供了相對穩定的競爭環境。","comment_en":"Barriers to entry in the financial services sector stem primarily from stringent regulatory requirements and licensing. KKR, as an established financial institution, has developed robust compliance systems and operational capabilities to meet regulatory standards globally. However, this is not a barrier based on patents or proprietary technology but rather a common industry entry hurdle. Changes in the regulatory landscape can present challenges, but also offer a relatively stable competitive environment for compliant, mature firms."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"對於機構投資者而言，更換資產管理公司涉及複雜的盡職調查、法律程序和重新配置資產的成本。一旦投資者與 KKR 建立了長期合作關係，並對其投資策略和團隊產生信任，轉換的成本和風險會顯著增加。這種關係的穩定性和信任的建立，構成了較高的客戶轉換成本，有利於 KKR 維護現有客戶基礎。","comment_en":"For institutional investors, changing asset management firms involves complex due diligence, legal procedures, and asset reallocation costs. Once investors establish a long-term relationship with KKR and develop trust in its investment strategies and team, the costs and risks of switching become significant. This relationship stability and trust build considerable switching costs for clients, helping KKR maintain its existing client base."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"KKR 的網絡效應體現在其龐大的全球網絡，包括投資者、被投公司、行業專家和潛在交易機會。這種網絡能夠產生協同效應，例如，一個領域的成功投資經驗可以吸引更多相關領域的交易機會，或為被投公司提供更廣泛的行業資源。投資者之間也可能因為 KKR 的聲譽和業績而產生信任，進而吸引更多資金，但這種網絡效應並非典型的指數級增長。","comment_en":"KKR's network effects manifest in its vast global network of investors, portfolio companies, industry experts, and potential deal flow. This network can generate synergies, where successful investment experience in one sector attracts more opportunities in related areas or provides broader industry resources to portfolio companies. Investors may also develop trust due to KKR's reputation and performance, attracting more capital. However, this network effect is not typically exponential."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"作為全球最大的另類資產管理公司之一，KKR 擁有顯著的規模優勢。龐大的資產管理規模（AUM）使其能夠分攤固定成本，降低單項交易的運營費用，並在與被投公司談判時獲得更有利的條款。同時，規模也使其能夠吸引和留住頂尖人才，並投入更多資源進行市場研究和交易篩選，從而提升整體效率和投資回報。","comment_en":"As one of the world's largest alternative asset managers, KKR possesses significant scale advantages. Its substantial Assets Under Management (AUM) allow for the absorption of fixed costs, reducing operational expenses per transaction and enabling more favorable terms when negotiating with portfolio companies. Scale also facilitates attracting and retaining top talent and dedicating more resources to market research and deal sourcing, enhancing overall efficiency and investment returns."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":5,"comment_zh":"KKR 的業務遍及全球，並在不同地區和行業進行投資，這使其能夠利用不同市場的機會。然而，其資產並非局限於特定的地理位置或獨特的自然資源，而是分散在全球範圍內的多元化投資組合。其優勢在於全球佈局和跨區域投資能力，而非特定地理位置的壟斷性資產。","comment_en":"KKR operates globally, investing across various regions and industries, allowing it to capitalize on opportunities in different markets. However, its assets are not tied to specific geographic locations or unique natural resources but are diversified across a global portfolio. Its strength lies in its global presence and cross-regional investment capabilities rather than monopolistic assets in particular geographies."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"KKR 在運營效率方面表現出色，這得益於其成熟的投資流程、風險管理系統和技術應用。公司能夠高效地篩選、評估、執行和管理投資項目，並通過其全球平台實現資源共享和協同效應。持續的技術投入和流程優化，使其在管理龐大資產的同時，保持較高的運營效率和盈利能力。","comment_en":"KKR demonstrates strong operational efficiency, driven by its mature investment processes, risk management systems, and technology adoption. The firm efficiently screens, evaluates, executes, and manages investments, leveraging its global platform for resource sharing and synergies. Continuous investment in technology and process optimization enables it to maintain high operational efficiency and profitability while managing substantial assets."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":9,"comment_zh":"KKR 的核心競爭力在於其卓越的資本配置能力。公司擅長識別被低估的資產，通過積極的運營改善和戰略調整來提升價值，並在適當的時機退出以實現最大化回報。其歷史業績證明了其在不同市場週期下，將資本配置到高回報機會上的卓越能力，這也是其長期成功的關鍵。","comment_en":"KKR's core strength lies in its exceptional capital allocation capabilities. The firm excels at identifying undervalued assets, enhancing their value through active operational improvements and strategic adjustments, and exiting at opportune moments to maximize returns. Its historical performance demonstrates a remarkable ability to deploy capital into high-return opportunities across various market cycles, a key driver of its long-term success."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"KKR 通過提供持續穩定的投資回報、卓越的客戶服務和定製化的解決方案，實現了高度的客戶忠誠度和留存率。機構投資者通常尋求長期穩定的合作夥伴，KKR 的業績記錄和專業聲譽使其成為首選。一旦建立信任，客戶傾向於長期持有，這為 KKR 提供了穩定的資金來源和可預測的收入。","comment_en":"KKR achieves high client loyalty and retention by delivering consistent investment returns, excellent client service, and customized solutions. Institutional investors typically seek long-term, stable partners, and KKR's track record and professional reputation make it a preferred choice. Once trust is established, clients tend to maintain long-term relationships, providing KKR with a stable source of capital and predictable revenue."},"m10_durability":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"KKR 的商業模式具有較強的持久性。其另類資產管理業務對經濟週期的敏感度相對較低，且通過多元化的投資策略和全球佈局，能夠分散風險。管理費收入提供了穩定的現金流基礎，而績效費則與投資成功掛鉤。只要 KKR 能持續保持其投資專長和聲譽，其業務模式就能在長期內保持韌性。","comment_en":"KKR's business model exhibits strong durability. Its alternative asset management business is relatively less sensitive to economic cycles, and diversification through various investment strategies and global presence mitigates risk. Management fees provide a stable revenue base, while performance fees are tied to investment success. As long as KKR maintains its investment expertise and reputation, its business model is poised to remain resilient over the long term."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"KKR 的護城河主要體現為其卓越的資本配置能力、顯著的規模經濟以及強大的全球網絡和聲譽。這使其能夠吸引頂級人才和龐大資金，並在投資交易中獲得優勢。其業務模式類似於一個「收費橋」，通過專業能力和網絡為投資者連接優質資產，並收取合理的費用。雖然面臨行業監管和競爭壓力，但其成熟的運營效率、客戶留存能力和品牌價值構成了堅固的壁壘，使其在另類資產管理領域具有持久的競爭優勢。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"KKR's moat is primarily built upon its exceptional capital allocation skills, significant economies of scale, and a robust global network and reputation. This allows it to attract top talent and substantial capital, gaining advantages in investment transactions. Its business model functions akin to a 'toll bridge,' connecting investors with quality assets through expertise and network, charging fees for this service. Despite regulatory and competitive pressures, its operational efficiency, client retention, and brand value form a solid barrier, providing a durable competitive advantage in alternative asset management.","evidenceHash":"f1f14b410718f00fe3682b6bc7dba84c9de0d9ca507f8bc9bad1fd540359a2e7","assessmentPolicy":"us-buffett-moat-v3"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null},"fScore":{"score":7,"checkedAt":null}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/KKRS.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/KKRS.png","website":"https://www.kkr.com","ceo":"Joseph Bae","full_time_employees":"5043","description":"This organization operates as a dedicated financial unit, primarily established to facilitate specific funding initiatives or other specialized objectives within the larger corporate structure.","description_en":"This organization operates as a dedicated financial unit, primarily established to facilitate specific funding initiatives or other specialized objectives within the larger corporate structure.","description_zh":"好的，身為資深證券分析師，我將為您翻譯並精煉 KKR Group Finance Co. IX LLC 4. (KKRS) 的官方業務營運描述，並採用台灣財經用語，力求客觀嚴謹，並符合字數要求。\n\n**KKR Group Finance Co. IX LLC 4. (KKRS) 業務營運描述（繁體中文 - 台灣財經用語）**\n\nKKR Group Finance Co. IX LLC 4. (KKRS) 係一專責性財務操作實體，其設立目的主要係為支援母集團（KKR）旗下特定投資專案或策略性財務規劃之資金募集與調度。該公司並非直接從事資產管理或投資顧問等核心業務，而是作為一個關鍵的融資平台，透過發行債務證券、安排銀行貸款或其他結構性融資工具，為 KKR 旗下基金或特定收購案提供所需的營運資金或資本支出。其營運模式高度聚焦於財務工程與資本市場操作，旨在優化集團整體資本結構、降低融資成本，並確保各項投資計畫的資金流動性與財務彈性。此類財務公司在大型私募股權基金集團中扮演著重要的後勤支援角色。","address":"30 Hudson Yards","city":"New York","state":"NY","zip":"10001","country":"US","phone":"+1 212 750 8300","full_address":"30 Hudson Yards, New York, NY 10001, US","range_52w":"15.01-18.51","year_high":18.51,"year_low":15.01,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":15.01,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[{"date":"2026-10-02","name":"KKR Alternative Assets LLC","title":"10 percent owner","is_buy":null,"action":"J-Other","shares":63653,"price":22.86,"total_val":1.46},{"date":"2026-09-18","name":"KKR Alternative Assets LLC","title":"10 percent owner","is_buy":null,"action":"J-Other","shares":1933109